# armour-spells: the saved game the armour-spells session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a scroll of Resist Blows (0x134, spell 3, armour
# level 2) and a scroll of Iron Flesh (spell 59, armour level 5), each as a level stores an
# enchanted scroll, into the pack. Saved in slot 1, described "armour"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
26000 key enter        # the difficulty
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key enter
36000 key enter
38000 key enter
40000 key a            # the name
40200 key v
40400 key a
40600 key t
40800 key a
41000 key r
42000 key enter
44000 key enter        # Yes
52000 cheat give 0x134 1 40 spell 3
53000 cheat give 0x134 1 40 spell 59
55000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "armour"
55100 key s
55300 up ctrl
57000 key enter
58500 key a
58700 key r
58900 key m
59100 key o
59300 key u
59500 key r
61500 key enter
